---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const villas = [
  ['Paradiso Villa', '7 bedrooms, up to 14 guests', '12,356 sq ft', 'The largest villa, across two levels above Paradise Bay, behind a secure gated entrance with a private driveway. Seven sea-facing bedrooms each with its own bathroom, a master with a private jacuzzi, a dedicated massage room, a heated private pool with a jacuzzi over the sea, a main terrace with outdoor dining and an outdoor kitchen, in-villa check-in, complimentary airport transfers, a 24/7 butler and a dedicated concierge'],
  ['Delos Villa', '7 bedrooms, up to 14 guests', '7,847 sq ft', 'The hotel&rsquo;s signature villa, across two levels joined by a private elevator. A grand terrace with a long private pool suspended over the sea, a private gym, seven sea-view bedrooms each with its own bathroom and outdoor access, indoor lounges and open-air dining, a 24/7 butler, a dedicated concierge and access to ROKA Beach Club. The sales team&rsquo;s personal favorite'],
  ['Rock Villa', '3 bedrooms and up to 6 guests today, 5 bedrooms from 2027', '2,799 sq ft', 'The most private villa, at the far end of the estate with the sea on both sides and views over Paraga and Paradiso bays. Single-story, with a panoramic terrace over the sea, a path through the rocks down to the water, outdoor access from every bedroom, a living room and kitchenette, a private pool, a 24/7 butler, a dedicated concierge and access to ROKA Beach Club'],
  ['Cyclades Villa', '2 bedrooms, up to 4 guests', '1,603 sq ft', 'Perched at the hotel&rsquo;s furthest point for privacy, with a pool running the full length of the villa facing the open sea'],
];

const faq = [
  ['What is the best villa in Mykonos?', 'For me, the villas at Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos. I toured them in May 2026, and they&rsquo;re modern, private and absolutely stunning, honestly another level compared to other Mykonos offerings. You get a private villa with a full luxury resort around it.'],
  ['How many villas does Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos have?', 'Four for 2027: Paradiso and Delos (seven bedrooms each, up to 14 guests), Rock (five bedrooms, new for 2027) and Cyclades (two bedrooms, up to 4 guests).'],
  ['What is the largest villa at Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos?', 'The Paradiso Villa: seven bedrooms and 12,356 square feet across two levels, for up to 14 guests. Every bedroom faces the sea for the sunrise over Paradise Bay, the master has its own jacuzzi, and there&rsquo;s a massage room, a gated private driveway, a large pool over the sea and an outdoor kitchen. Poolside BBQs and DJ sets can be arranged on request.'],
  ['Is Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos good for a group of friends or a family?', 'Yes. The seven-bedroom villas sleep up to 14, which works for a milestone birthday, a multi-family trip or a group of friends, and you have ZUMA, an underground sports court and Paraga Beach on your doorstep.'],
  ['What is the best villa at Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos?', 'The Delos Villa is the hotel&rsquo;s signature: seven sea-view bedrooms for up to 14 guests across two levels with a private elevator, and a long private pool suspended over the open sea. A 24/7 butler and dedicated concierge are included, and a private chef or a sunset reception can be arranged on request.'],
  ['Which Fouquet&rsquo;s villa is the most private?', 'The Rock Villa. It sits at the far end of the estate, bordered by the sea on both sides with views over Paraga and Paradiso bays, and a small path through the rocks leads straight down to the water. It comes with a 24/7 butler, a dedicated concierge and access to ROKA Beach Club, and a chef or a private sunset reception can be arranged on request.'],
  ['Where is Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos?', 'On the south coast at Paraga, within walking distance of Paraga Beach and Scorpios, so you get the energy of the south coast with the comfort of a true luxury resort.'],
  ['How much do the villas cost?', 'Rates depend on the villa, the season and the length of stay, so ask me for your dates and group size and I&rsquo;ll come back with the right villa.'],
];
---
<Layout
  canonical="fouquets-mykonos-villas.html"
  title="Fouquet's Mykonos Villas: The Best Private Villas in Mykonos | Suites With Keith"
  description="Keith's firsthand look at the four private villas at Fouquet's Mykonos: Paradiso and Delos (seven bedrooms, up to 14 guests), Rock (five bedrooms) and Cyclades (two bedrooms). Modern, private villas with a full luxury resort around them on the south coast."
  preload="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-pool.jpg"
  ctaLabel="Ask about the villas"
>

<script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faq.map(([q, a]) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: q.replace(/&rsquo;/g, '’'), acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').replace(/&rsquo;/g, '’') } })),
})} />

<header class="hero" style="min-height:min(78svh,720px);">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-pool.jpg" alt="The long private pool of the Delos Villa, suspended over the sea at dusk, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1230" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mykonos &middot; Toured May 2026</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl" style="margin-top:18px;">The Villas at Fouquet&rsquo;s Mykonos</h1>
    <p class="sub">Four private villas on the south coast, from two bedrooms to seven, and just another level compared to the rest of Mykonos.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#inquire" data-gtag-label="start_planning" data-gtag-location="hero">Ask about the villas</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-shadow" href="/hotels/fouquets-mykonos.html" style="border-color:rgba(242,239,230,.4); color:var(--band-ink);">Read my Fouquet&rsquo;s review</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="deck" style="max-width:44ch;">I toured the villas in May 2026. They&rsquo;re modern, private and absolutely stunning, honestly another level compared to other Mykonos offerings.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:20px; max-width:62ch;">Fouquet&rsquo;s is my pick for Best New Resort in Greece. It brings the energy of Mykonos&rsquo; south coast together with the comfort of a true luxury resort, and I had the chance to tour it while it was still under construction, so returning after it opened was especially rewarding.</p>
      <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:14px; max-width:62ch;">The villas are where it really separates itself. Most Mykonos villa rentals leave you on your own for food, service and logistics. Here you have a private villa with ZUMA for dinner, an underground sports court, polished service and Paraga Beach and Scorpios a walk away.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:960px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">For 2027</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The four villas</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="villa-table reveal" role="table" aria-label="Fouquet's Mykonos villas">
      <div class="vt-row vt-head" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Villa</span><span role="columnheader">Sleeps</span><span role="columnheader">Size</span><span role="columnheader">Notes</span></div>
      {villas.map(([n, s, z, note]) => (
        <div class="vt-row" role="row"><span role="cell" class="vt-name" set:html={n} /><span role="cell" set:html={s} /><span role="cell" set:html={z} /><span role="cell" set:html={note} /></div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="photos reveal">
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-paradiso-villa-pool-wide.jpg" alt="The large heated pool, palms and Paradise Bay from the Paradiso Villa terrace, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1226" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Paradiso Villa: the heated pool and Paradise Bay</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-paradiso-villa-exterior.jpg" alt="The two-level stone and whitewashed Paradiso Villa above its pool, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1014" height="692" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Paradiso Villa: two levels of stone and whitewash</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-paradiso-villa-pool.jpg" alt="The Paradiso Villa pool and palms looking over Paradise Bay, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="998" height="1626" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Paradiso Villa: the pool, looking over Paradise Bay</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-paradiso-villa-aerial.jpg" alt="An aerial view of the Paradiso Villa terrace and pool above the rocky shoreline, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1226" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Paradiso Villa: the terrace and pool from above, right on the rocks</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-paradiso-villa-bathroom.jpg" alt="A stone double-vanity bathroom in the Paradiso Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1236" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Paradiso Villa: one of seven bathrooms</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-paradiso-villa-vanity.jpg" alt="A travertine double vanity in the Paradiso Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1014" height="1516" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Paradiso Villa: travertine vanities</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="photos reveal" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-rock-villa-terrace.jpg" alt="A shaded stone terrace with lounge chairs at the Rock Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1229" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Rock Villa: A shaded terrace off the stone walls</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-rock-villa-king-bedroom.jpg" alt="A king bedroom with a timber ceiling at the Rock Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1237" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Rock Villa: A king bedroom under a timber ceiling</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-rock-villa-bedroom-en-suite.jpg" alt="A bedroom opening onto its en-suite bathroom at the Rock Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1010" height="690" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Rock Villa: A bedroom with its own bathroom</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-rock-villa-bathroom.jpg" alt="A stone double-vanity bathroom looking onto an olive-tree courtyard at the Rock Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1006" height="684" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Rock Villa: Double vanities and an olive-tree courtyard</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="photos reveal" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-living-room.jpg" alt="The Delos Villa living room opening onto the terrace and the sea at sunset, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1036" height="692" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa: the living room, open to the terrace at sunset</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-dining.jpg" alt="The long dining table under a timber ceiling in the Delos Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1233" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa: dining for fourteen, over the lower level</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-bedroom.jpg" alt="A king bedroom with a timber ceiling and woven headboard wall in the Delos Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1156" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa: one of the seven sea-view bedrooms</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-garden-bedroom.jpg" alt="A Delos Villa bedroom opening onto a patio and lawn by the sea, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="994" height="1558" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa: a ground-floor bedroom opening onto the sea</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-bathroom.jpg" alt="A travertine bathroom with a woven freestanding tub in the Delos Villa, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1800" height="1225" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa: a travertine bathroom with a freestanding tub</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-beach.jpg" alt="Loungers and umbrellas on the beach below Fouquet's Mykonos, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1012" height="682" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>The beach below the estate</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="photos plans reveal" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-floor-plan-upper.jpg" alt="Upper-level floor plan of the Delos Villa, with the pool terrace, living and dining rooms, kitchen and master suite, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1670" height="1236" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa floor plan: the upper level, with the pool terrace, living, dining, kitchen and master suite</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/hotels/fouquets-delos-villa-floor-plan-lower.jpg" alt="Lower-level floor plan of the Delos Villa, with bedrooms opening onto sea-facing patios, a gym and the elevator, Fouquet's Mykonos" width="1668" height="1240" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Delos Villa floor plan: the lower level, with bedrooms opening onto patios by the sea, a gym and the elevator</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">How I&rsquo;d choose</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Which villa, for which trip</h2>
    <ul class="why reveal">
      <li><b>A milestone birthday or a big group of friends:</b> Paradiso, the largest, built for celebrations, with a gated private entrance, a big pool over the sea, an outdoor kitchen and poolside BBQs or a DJ set on request.</li>
      <li><b>Two or three families together:</b> Delos, the signature villa, with a private elevator between its two levels and every bedroom opening onto the pool terrace or a shaded patio by the sea.</li>
      <li><b>Privacy above everything:</b> Rock, at the far end of the estate with the sea on both sides and a path down to the water. It&rsquo;s being upgraded from three bedrooms to five for 2027.</li>
      <li><b>A couple, two couples, or a small family:</b> Cyclades, the two-bedroom at the hotel&rsquo;s furthest point, with a pool running the length of the villa.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Booking through me</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Fora perks, and someone who knows Fouquet&rsquo;s</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="body-2 reveal" style="max-width:62ch;">I know the property and the sales team, so I&rsquo;ll match you to the right villa, line up dinners at ZUMA and set up the rest of Mykonos before you arrive. My clients receive Fora perks on eligible stays, and rates are identical to booking direct.</p>
    <dl class="kv reveal" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>On the island</dt><dd>Beach clubs, dinners and <a href="/mykonos-excursions.html">boat days and excursions</a></dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Getting there</dt><dd>Private transfers, and <a href="/private-boat-transfers.html">private boats</a> to the other islands</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>More Mykonos</dt><dd>My <a href="/mykonos.html">Mykonos guide</a> and <a href="/fouquets-vs-bill-and-coo-coast-mykonos.html">Fouquet&rsquo;s vs. Bill &amp; Coo Coast</a></dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>More Mykonos villas</dt><dd><a href="/four-seasons-mykonos-villas.html">Four Seasons Mykonos</a>, two villas above a private beach</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Before you ask</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The questions I get</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq reveal">
      {faq.map(([q, a]) => (
        <details>
          <summary set:html={q} />
          <p class="body-2" set:html={a} />
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section inquire band on-shadow" id="inquire" style="scroll-margin-top:70px;">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">The Fouquet&rsquo;s Villas</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">When are you thinking?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:44ch;">Tell me your dates, who&rsquo;s coming and the occasion. I&rsquo;ll check the villas and plan the rest of the islands around them.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Fouquet's Mykonos villa inquiry" />
      <input type="hidden" name="hotel" value="Fouquet's Mykonos Villas" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="fouquets-mykonos-villas" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when" style="color:var(--band-ash);">When are you thinking?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="July 2027 · 5 nights · 12 guests" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name" style="color:var(--band-ash);">And where do I send the plan?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
        <label for="q-details" style="margin-top:2px; color:var(--band-ash);">Anything else? Occasion, kids&rsquo; ages, the rest of the trip (optional)</label>
        <input id="q-details" type="text" name="details" placeholder="40th birthday · then Paros" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn" data-gtag-label="villa_inquiry_send" data-gtag-location="villa_cta">Send</button>
      <p class="note" style="color:var(--band-ash);">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .photos img { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
  .plans img { aspect-ratio: auto; object-fit: contain; background: var(--lime); }
  .villa-table { margin-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline-firm); }
  .vt-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); font-size: .95rem; }
  .vt-head { display: none; }
  .vt-name { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .vt-row { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1.4fr 1fr 2.4fr; gap: 20px; align-items: baseline; }
    .vt-head { display: grid; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); }
  }
  .why { margin-top: 24px; padding-left: 1.1em; max-width: 62ch; }
  .why li { margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .faq details { border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 18px 0; }
  .faq details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .faq summary { cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.2rem; list-style: none; position: relative; padding-right: 28px; }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq summary::after { content: "+"; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; color: var(--brass); font-family: var(--body); }
  .faq details[open] summary::after { content: "\2013"; }
  .faq details p { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 62ch; }
</style>
